    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d228-a1">

                <pb facs="0449" n="403" xml:id="pg403"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 1]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sato</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to Colonel E. M. House </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 8, 1917</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Colonel House</hi>: For your kind reception
                    and open-hearted talk which I had the pleasure of enjoying in New York, I wish
                    you to accept my warm and sincere thanks.</p>
                <p>According to your suggestion, I have since prepared a memorandum succintly
                    setting forth the point which found [<hi rendition="#italic">formed?</hi>] a
                    part of our conversation and I am taking the liberty to send it to you for
                    whatever you may see fit.</p>
                <p>Mr Oscar S. Straus called on me two days after I had the pleasant interview with
                    you, and he was telling me about his idea of making the most of the present
                    trend of things for fostering better relations between our countries. It is
                    indeed gratifying to find evidences indicating that a more serious interest in
                    our relations is actually being taken in this country and especially among men
                    of great influence.</p>
                <p>With high regard [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Aimaro Sato</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
